I"�]<p>Go 문법을 훑고 나서, 배운 걸 실제로 굴려보려고 작은 예제 두 개를 만들었다.
계좌(BankAccount)와 사전(Dictionary)인데, 둘 다 코드는 짧지만 Go에서 <strong>타입에 동작을 붙이는 방식</strong>과 <strong>에러를 값으로 다루는 방식</strong>이 그대로 드러난다.</p>

<p>다른 언어의 클래스에 익숙하다면 이 두 예제가 가장 헷갈리는 지점이기도 해서, 코드와 함께 왜 이렇게 쓰는지를 같이 정리했다.</p>

<p><br /></p>

<h2 id="1-bankaccount---포인터-리시버와-커스텀-에러">1. BankAccount - 포인터 리시버와 커스텀 에러</h2>

<p>계좌에 입금하고, 출금하고, 잔액을 조회하는 예제다.</p>

<div class="language-go highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="k">package</span> <span class="n">accounts</span>

<span class="k">import</span> <span class="p">(</span>
	<span class="s">"errors"</span>
	<span class="s">"fmt"</span>
<span class="p">)</span>

<span class="c">// Account struct</span>
<span class="k">type</span> <span class="n">Account</span> <span class="k">struct</span> <span class="p">{</span>
	<span class="n">owner</span>   <span class="kt">string</span>
	<span class="n">balance</span> <span class="kt">int</span>
<span class="p">}</span>

<span class="k">var</span> <span class="n">errnoMoney</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">errors</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">New</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">"Can't withdraw"</span><span class="p">)</span>

<span class="c">// NewAccount creates Account</span>
<span class="k">func</span> <span class="n">NewAccount</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">owner</span> <span class="kt">string</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="o">*</span><span class="n">Account</span> <span class="p">{</span>
	<span class="n">account</span> <span class="o">:=</span> <span class="n">Account</span><span class="p">{</span><span class="n">owner</span><span class="o">:</span> <span class="n">owner</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">balance</span><span class="o">:</span> <span class="m">0</span><span class="p">}</span>
	<span class="k">return</span> <span class="o">&amp;</span><span class="n">account</span>
<span class="p">}</span>

<span class="c">// Deposit x amount on your account</span>
<span class="k">func</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="n">a</span> <span class="o">*</span><span class="n">Account</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="n">Deposit</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">amount</span> <span class="kt">int</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="p">{</span>
	<span class="n">a</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">balance</span> <span class="o">+=</span> <span class="n">amount</span>
<span class="p">}</span>

<span class="c">// Balance of your account</span>
<span class="k">func</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="n">a</span> <span class="n">Account</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="n">Balance</span><span class="p">()</span> <span class="kt">int</span> <span class="p">{</span>
	<span class="k">return</span> <span class="n">a</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">balance</span>
<span class="p">}</span>

<span class="c">// Withdraw x amount from your account</span>
<span class="k">func</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="n">a</span> <span class="o">*</span><span class="n">Account</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="n">Withdraw</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">amount</span> <span class="kt">int</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="kt">error</span> <span class="p">{</span>
	<span class="k">if</span> <span class="n">a</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">balance</span> <span class="o">&lt;</span> <span class="n">amount</span> <span class="p">{</span>
		<span class="k">return</span> <span class="n">errnoMoney</span>
	<span class="p">}</span>
	<span class="n">a</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">balance</span> <span class="o">-=</span> <span class="n">amount</span>
	<span class="k">return</span> <span class="no">nil</span>		<span class="c">//nil = null, err no exist</span>
<span class="p">}</span>

<span class="c">// ChangeOnwer of the account</span>
<span class="k">func</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="n">a</span> <span class="o">*</span><span class="n">Account</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="n">ChangeOwner</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">newOwner</span> <span class="kt">string</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="p">{</span>
	<span class="n">a</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">owner</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">newOwner</span>
<span class="p">}</span>

<span class="k">func</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="n">a</span> <span class="n">Account</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="n">Owner</span><span class="p">()</span> <span class="kt">string</span> <span class="p">{</span>
	<span class="k">return</span> <span class="n">a</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">owner</span>
<span class="p">}</span>

<span class="k">func</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="n">a</span> <span class="n">Account</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="n">String</span><span class="p">()</span> <span class="kt">string</span> <span class="p">{</span>
	<span class="k">return</span> <span class="n">fmt</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">Sprint</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">a</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">Owner</span><span class="p">(),</span> <span class="s">"'s account.</span><span class="se">\n</span><span class="s">Has: "</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">a</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">Balance</span><span class="p">())</span>
<span class="p">}</span>

</code></pre></div></div>

<div class="language-go highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="k">package</span> <span class="n">main</span>

<span class="k">import</span> <span class="p">(</span>
	<span class="s">"fmt"</span>

	<span class="s">"github.com/y00913/learngo/accounts"</span>
<span class="p">)</span>

<span class="k">func</span> <span class="n">main</span><span class="p">()</span> <span class="p">{</span>
	<span class="n">account</span> <span class="o">:=</span> <span class="n">accounts</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">NewAccount</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">"nico"</span><span class="p">)</span>
	<span class="n">account</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">Deposit</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="m">10</span><span class="p">)</span>
	<span class="n">fmt</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">Println</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">account</span><span class="p">)</span>
<span class="p">}</span>

</code></pre></div></div>

<h3 id="값-리시버와-포인터-리시버">값 리시버와 포인터 리시버</h3>

<p>여기서 제일 중요한 건 함수 앞에 붙은 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">(a Account)</code>와 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">(a *Account)</code>의 차이다.</p>

<div class="language-go highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="k">func</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="n">a</span> <span class="o">*</span><span class="n">Account</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="n">Deposit</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">amount</span> <span class="kt">int</span><span class="p">)</span>   <span class="c">// 포인터 리시버</span>
<span class="k">func</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="n">a</span> <span class="n">Account</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="n">Balance</span><span class="p">()</span> <span class="kt">int</span>          <span class="c">// 값 리시버</span>
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>Go는 기본이 <strong>값 복사</strong>다. <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">(a Account)</code>로 받으면 메서드 안의 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">a</code>는 원본이 아니라 복사본이다.
그래서 값 리시버로 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">a.balance += amount</code>를 해봤자 복사본만 바뀌고 원본 계좌는 그대로다. 컴파일 에러도 안 나서 더 헷갈린다.</p>

<p>반대로 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">(a *Account)</code>는 주소를 받으므로 원본을 고칠 수 있다. 그래서 규칙은 단순하다.</p>

<ul>
  <li><strong>상태를 바꾸는 메서드</strong>(<code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">Deposit</code>, <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">Withdraw</code>, <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">ChangeOwner</code>) → 포인터 리시버</li>
  <li><strong>읽기만 하는 메서드</strong>(<code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">Balance</code>, <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">Owner</code>) → 값 리시버도 됨</li>
</ul>

<p><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">NewAccount</code>가 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">*Account</code>를 리턴하는 것도 같은 이유다. 값으로 리턴하면 이후에 포인터 메서드를 부를 때 매번 주소를 따로 잡아야 한다.</p>

<h3 id="에러를-미리-만들어-두는-이유">에러를 미리 만들어 두는 이유</h3>

<div class="language-go highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="k">var</span> <span class="n">errnoMoney</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">errors</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">New</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">"Can't withdraw"</span><span class="p">)</span>
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>에러를 함수 안에서 매번 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">errors.New(...)</code>로 만들지 않고 패키지 수준 변수로 빼 뒀다.
이렇게 해야 호출하는 쪽에서 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">if err == errnoMoney</code> 처럼 <strong>어떤 에러인지 구분</strong>할 수 있기 때문이다.
매번 새로 만들면 메시지는 같아도 서로 다른 값이라 비교가 안 된다.</p>

<p>Go에는 예외(exception)가 없고 에러가 그냥 리턴값이다. 그래서 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">Withdraw</code>는 성공하면 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">nil</code>, 실패하면 에러 값을 돌려준다.</p>

<h3 id="string-을-정의하면-출력이-바뀐다">String() 을 정의하면 출력이 바뀐다</h3>

<div class="language-go highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="k">func</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="n">a</span> <span class="n">Account</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="n">String</span><span class="p">()</span> <span class="kt">string</span> <span class="p">{</span>
	<span class="k">return</span> <span class="n">fmt</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">Sprint</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">a</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">Owner</span><span class="p">(),</span> <span class="s">"'s account.</span><span class="se">\n</span><span class="s">Has: "</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">a</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">Balance</span><span class="p">())</span>
<span class="p">}</span>
</code></pre></div></div>

<p><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">main</code>에서 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">fmt.Println(account)</code>를 했는데 구조체 내용이 아니라 사람이 읽을 문장이 찍힌다.
<code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">String() string</code> 메서드가 있으면 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">fmt</code>가 출력할 때 그걸 대신 쓰기 때문이다.
Java의 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">toString()</code>과 같은 역할인데, Go에서는 상속이나 선언 없이 <strong>메서드 이름만 맞으면</strong> 자동으로 적용된다.</p>

<p><br /></p>

<h2 id="2-dictionary---map에-메서드를-붙이기">2. Dictionary - map에 메서드를 붙이기</h2>

<p>단어를 넣고, 찾고, 수정하고, 지우는 사전이다.</p>

<div class="language-go highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="k">package</span> <span class="n">mydict</span>

<span class="k">import</span> <span class="s">"errors"</span>

<span class="c">// Dictionary type</span>
<span class="k">type</span> <span class="n">Dictionary</span> <span class="k">map</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="kt">string</span><span class="p">]</span><span class="kt">string</span>

<span class="k">var</span> <span class="p">(</span>
	<span class="n">errNotFound</span>   <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">errors</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">New</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">"Not Found"</span><span class="p">)</span>
	<span class="n">errCantUpdate</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">errors</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">New</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">"Cant update non-existing word"</span><span class="p">)</span>
	<span class="n">errWordExists</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">errors</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">New</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">"That word  already exists"</span><span class="p">)</span>
<span class="p">)</span>

<span class="c">// Search for a word</span>
<span class="k">func</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="n">d</span> <span class="n">Dictionary</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="n">Search</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">word</span> <span class="kt">string</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">string</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="kt">error</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="p">{</span>
	<span class="n">value</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">exists</span> <span class="o">:=</span> <span class="n">d</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">word</span><span class="p">]</span>
	<span class="k">if</span> <span class="n">exists</span> <span class="p">{</span>
		<span class="k">return</span> <span class="n">value</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="no">nil</span>
	<span class="p">}</span>
	<span class="k">return</span> <span class="s">""</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">errNotFound</span>
<span class="p">}</span>

<span class="c">// Add a word to the dictionary</span>
<span class="k">func</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="n">d</span> <span class="n">Dictionary</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="n">Add</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">word</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">def</span> <span class="kt">string</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="kt">error</span> <span class="p">{</span>
	<span class="n">_</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">err</span> <span class="o">:=</span> <span class="n">d</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">Search</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">word</span><span class="p">)</span>
	<span class="k">switch</span> <span class="n">err</span> <span class="p">{</span>
	<span class="k">case</span> <span class="n">errNotFound</span><span class="o">:</span>
		<span class="n">d</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">word</span><span class="p">]</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">def</span>
	<span class="k">case</span> <span class="no">nil</span><span class="o">:</span>
		<span class="k">return</span> <span class="n">errWordExists</span>
	<span class="p">}</span>

	<span class="k">return</span> <span class="no">nil</span>
<span class="p">}</span>

<span class="c">// Update a word</span>
<span class="k">func</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="n">d</span> <span class="n">Dictionary</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="n">Update</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">word</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">definition</span> <span class="kt">string</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="kt">error</span> <span class="p">{</span>
	<span class="n">_</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">err</span> <span class="o">:=</span> <span class="n">d</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">Search</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">word</span><span class="p">)</span>
	<span class="k">switch</span> <span class="n">err</span> <span class="p">{</span>
	<span class="k">case</span> <span class="no">nil</span><span class="o">:</span>
		<span class="n">d</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">word</span><span class="p">]</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">definition</span>
	<span class="k">case</span> <span class="n">errNotFound</span><span class="o">:</span>
		<span class="k">return</span> <span class="n">errCantUpdate</span>
	<span class="p">}</span>
	<span class="k">return</span> <span class="no">nil</span>
<span class="p">}</span>

<span class="c">// Delete a word</span>
<span class="k">func</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="n">d</span> <span class="n">Dictionary</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="n">Delete</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">word</span> <span class="kt">string</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="p">{</span>
	<span class="nb">delete</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">d</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">word</span><span class="p">)</span>
<span class="p">}</span>

</code></pre></div></div>
<div class="language-go highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="k">package</span> <span class="n">main</span>

<span class="k">import</span> <span class="p">(</span>
	<span class="s">"fmt"</span>

	<span class="s">"github.com/y00913/learngo/mydict"</span>
<span class="p">)</span>

<span class="k">func</span> <span class="n">main</span><span class="p">()</span> <span class="p">{</span>
	<span class="n">dictionary</span> <span class="o">:=</span> <span class="n">mydict</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">Dictionary</span><span class="p">{</span><span class="s">"first"</span><span class="o">:</span> <span class="s">"First word"</span><span class="p">}</span>
	<span class="n">baseWord</span> <span class="o">:=</span> <span class="s">"hello"</span>
	<span class="n">dictionary</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">Add</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">baseWord</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="s">"First"</span><span class="p">)</span>
	<span class="n">dictionary</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">Search</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">baseWord</span><span class="p">)</span>
	<span class="n">dictionary</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">Delete</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">baseWord</span><span class="p">)</span>
	<span class="n">word</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">err</span> <span class="o">:=</span> <span class="n">dictionary</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">Search</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">baseWord</span><span class="p">)</span>
	<span class="k">if</span> <span class="n">err</span> <span class="o">!=</span> <span class="no">nil</span> <span class="p">{</span>
		<span class="n">fmt</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">Println</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">err</span><span class="p">)</span>
	<span class="p">}</span> <span class="k">else</span> <span class="p">{</span>
		<span class="n">fmt</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">Println</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">word</span><span class="p">)</span>
	<span class="p">}</span>
<span class="p">}</span>

</code></pre></div></div>

<h3 id="map에-직접-메서드를-붙일-수-있다">map에 직접 메서드를 붙일 수 있다</h3>

<div class="language-go highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="k">type</span> <span class="n">Dictionary</span> <span class="k">map</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="kt">string</span><span class="p">]</span><span class="kt">string</span>
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>이 한 줄이 이 예제의 핵심이다. <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">map[string]string</code>에 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">Dictionary</code>라는 이름을 붙여 <strong>새 타입</strong>을 만들었다.
Go에서는 이렇게 내가 정의한 타입에는 메서드를 붙일 수 있어서, 구조체로 감싸지 않고도 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">Search</code>, <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">Add</code> 같은 동작을 map에 직접 달 수 있다.</p>

<p>여기서는 리시버가 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">(d Dictionary)</code> — 값 리시버인데도 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">d[word] = def</code>가 원본에 반영된다.
<code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">Account</code> 때와 반대로 보이지만 이유가 있다. <strong>map은 내부적으로 참조 타입</strong>이라, 복사해도 같은 데이터를 가리키기 때문이다.
슬라이스와 채널도 마찬가지다. 구조체와 헷갈리기 쉬운 부분이다.</p>

<h3 id="comma-ok-패턴">comma ok 패턴</h3>

<div class="language-go highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="n">value</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">exists</span> <span class="o">:=</span> <span class="n">d</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">word</span><span class="p">]</span>
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>map에서 값을 꺼낼 때 두 번째 리턴값으로 <strong>키가 실제로 있었는지</strong>를 받을 수 있다.
이걸 안 쓰면 없는 키를 꺼내도 에러가 아니라 타입의 기본값(문자열이면 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">""</code>)이 나와서, 값이 빈 문자열인 건지 키가 없는 건지 구분할 수 없다.</p>

<p><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">Add</code>와 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">Update</code>가 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">Search</code>를 먼저 부르는 것도 이 때문이다. 존재 여부를 확인해서 각각 다른 에러를 돌려준다.</p>

<ul>
  <li><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">Add</code> — 이미 있으면 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">errWordExists</code></li>
  <li><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">Update</code> — 없으면 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">errCantUpdate</code></li>
</ul>

<p>에러를 <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">switch err</code>로 분기하는 방식은, 앞서 계좌 예제에서 에러를 변수로 빼 뒀기에 가능한 것이다.</p>

<p><br /></p>

<h2 id="정리하며">정리하며</h2>

<p>두 예제를 만들면서 정리된 건 결국 세 가지다.</p>

<ul>
  <li>상태를 바꿀 거면 포인터 리시버, 읽기만 하면 값 리시버. 단 map·슬라이스는 값 리시버여도 원본이 바뀐다.</li>
  <li>에러는 예외가 아니라 리턴값이고, 구분해야 하면 패키지 변수로 미리 만들어 둔다.</li>
  <li><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">String()</code>처럼 이름만 맞추면 동작이 끼워지는 방식이 Go의 인터페이스 개념으로 이어진다.</li>
</ul>

<p>코드 자체는 30줄짜리인데, 다른 언어를 쓰다 넘어오면 걸리는 지점이 이 안에 거의 다 들어 있었다.</p>
